; XTRA
; Embedded .xtra Header
;
; General Info
; -------------------------------------------------------
; Residents       = ""
; /XTRA
; ^ with a negative base (#1189) in AB3 mode: AmiBlitz3's math library
; (44) computes it, as in AmiBlitz3 v3.14.0, which drops the sign of the
; power like the original (BB2 mode has the fix in library 192)
vf.f=-2.5 : vm.w=-2 : nw.w=3 : rl.l=0
NPrint vf^3
NPrint vf^nw
NPrint vm^2
NPrint vm^-1
rl=vf^nw : NPrint rl
NPrint (-3)^3.5
End
